From 948a149f1beb42fb67f762d2ea5ee84f7f5475de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jpk0512 <jlapm9@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:04:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add a transcriptPrelude plugin slot above the native chat
 timeline.

The chat pane mounts registered prelude components as leadingContent so
Recall can render prior-session Ledger history inside the session window
after a provider switch. Older plugin bundles omit the slot and stay valid.
